  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {追肥|ついひ}をする/{追肥|ついひ}する (to apply additional fertilizer)\n- {追肥|ついひ}を{与|あた}える (to give additional fertilizer)\n\nGARDENING CONTEXT:\n{追肥|ついひ} contrasts with {元肥|もとひ}/{元肥|もとごえ} (base fertilizer applied before or at planting). Plants often need supplemental nutrition during active growth.\n\nTYPES OF FERTILIZER:\n- {液肥|えきひ} (liquid fertilizer)\n- {化成肥料|かせいひりょう} (chemical fertilizer)\n- {有機肥料|ゆうきひりょう} (organic fertilizer)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {元肥|もとひ} (base fertilizer)\n- {肥料|ひりょう} (fertilizer)\n- {施肥|せひ} (fertilization)",
